# Mesa de pedidos — ejemplos manuales
# Requiere el API en http://localhost:8080 y la base con datos de prueba.

@host = http://localhost:8080

### Salud
GET {{host}}/api/v1/health

### Clientes
GET {{host}}/api/v1/customers

### Alta de cliente
POST {{host}}/api/v1/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Paula",
  "paternalLastName": "Ibarra",
  "maternalLastName": "Nava",
  "email": "paula.ibarra@correo.com"
}

### Pedidos
GET {{host}}/api/v1/orders?size=20

### Typeahead
GET {{host}}/api/v1/orders/suggestions?term=jose

### Sin coincidencias
GET {{host}}/api/v1/orders/suggestions?term=zzzz

### Filtro
GET {{host}}/api/v1/orders?term=LP-ELC
